   "desc": "Chicago Enterprise AI **Important**: Register on the [event website](https://bit.ly/3THfyh7) is required for admission. RSVP on meetup is turned off. **Databricks DevConnect** is a technical meetup where data and AI practitioners dig into the details, collaborate, learn, and find their people, hosted by the Databricks Developer Relations team. Together, we’ll chat about new features, dive into meaty topics, share real-world experiences, and explore new ways to use Databricks so you can become the best developer you can be. **​​Why Attend:** 🏆 **Become a 10x data and AI practitioner** by using the best of Databricks for your Data + AI projects. 🧠 **Learn from exclusive experts** you won’t hear anywhere else, including Product Managers, DevRel, Field Engineers, and MVPs. ​​​🤝 **Connect with your community** and build lasting relationships with fellow practitioners and Databricks Developer Advocates, MVPs, and Product teams. ​​👕 **Get those goodies:** Swag will be raffled off throughout the event and attendees will get access to hands-on training and guided labs through Databricks Academy Labs post event! **Speakers:** * ​Scott Haines, Staff Developer Advocate, Databricks * Ryan Bruun, Delivery Solutions Architect, Databricks * Joseph Ayoub, Sr. Delivery Solutions Architect, Databricks * **Agenda:** * 5:00 PM \\- 6:00 PM \\| Registration & Mingling * 6:00 PM \\- 6:05 PM \\| Welcome Remarks * 6:15 PM \\- 6:45 PM \\| Session \\#1: Artisanal hand crafted data builds * 6:45 PM \\- 7:15 PM \\| Session \\#2: Token maxxing data builds * 7:15 PM \\- 7:45 PM \\| Session \\#3: Handing builds to the masses * 7:45 PM \\- 8:00 PM \\| Closing Remarks * 8:00 PM \\- 9:00 PM \\| Networking Reception with bites and beverages *",
